    "vs_autocorr": "ACF(1)/serial correlation is LINEAR lag-1 covariance/correlation; TP counts LOCAL SIGN REVERSALS of consecutive differences (triplet oscillation count) \u2014 different statistic/sensitivity (monotone drift: high ACF, zero TP; rapid oscillation: high TP regardless of linear corr).",
